pth and texture.\n\n**Text & Typography:**\n- On the left side of the image, there is prominent text:\n  - At the top, a small logo with \"XX\" and a stylized face.\n  - Below it, the tagline: \"THE CHAOS. THE SPARK. THE SMILE. — SHE LAUGHS FIRST. EVERYTHING ELSE BLOWS UP.\"\n  - The name \"JINX\" is displayed in large, bold, distressed lettering, with a pink streak cutting diagonally across it.\n  - Beneath her name: \"THE LOOSE CANON\" and \"LEAGUE OF LEGENDS\".\n  - At the bottom, Chinese characters: \"金克丝\" (Jīn Kè Sī, the Chinese name for Jinx), followed"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 159, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 98, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [157], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-1718.5828857421875, -421.977294921875], "widgets_values": ["白色机器人"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 96, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "BOOLEAN", "links": [151], "label": "BOOLEAN", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "布尔"}], "size": [210, 58], "pos": [-2144.74560546875, -1104.5096435546875], "widgets_values": [true], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 92, "type": "PrimitiveBoolean", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveBoolean"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "BOOLEAN", "links": [158], "label": "BOOLEAN", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "布尔"}], "size": [210, 59.68950653076172], "pos"